IST.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig3"},{"sentence_id":"holdout3_012_s12","report_id":"holdout3_012","text":"On SVHN, Ours obtains a accuracy of 72.1%.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig3"},{"sentence_id":"holdout3_012_s13","report_id":"holdout3_012","text":"Ours scores 10 points higher on AG News than on Fashion-MNIST.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig3"},{"sentence_id":"holdout3_012_s14","report_id":"holdout3_012","text":"Figure 4 shows the accuracy by dataset.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig3"},{"sentence_id":"holdout3_012_s15","report_id":"holdout3_012","text":"LSTM reaches 73.9% accuracy on CIFAR-10 (Figure 4).","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig4"},{"sentence_id":"holdout3_012_s16","report_id":"holdout3_012","text":"DistilBERT outperforms MobileNet by 1.4 percentage points on SVHN.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig4"},{"sentence_id":"holdout3_012_s17","report_id":"holdout3_012","text":"SVM reaches 73.9% accuracy on CIFAR-10.","page":2,"nearest_figure_id":"fig4"},{"sentence_id":"holdout3_012_s18","report_id":"holdout3_012","text":"We note that the training was stable for all models.","page":2,"nearest_figure_id":"fig4"}]}